<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina places 250 mln pesos in 91-day Letes.</title>
<headline>Argentina places 250 mln pesos in 91-day Letes.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina Tuesday placed 250 million pesos in 91-day Letes Treasury bills at a cut-off yield of 6.28 percent, the Economy Ministry said.</p>
<p>There were 111 bids on the bills for a bid-to-cover ratio of 6.46 times.  </p>
<p>The price at the cut-off yield was 984.126.</p>
<p>Market-makers will be offered up to 10 percent more of both issues until 1730 local/2030 GMT Tuesday.</p>
<p>Settlement is due April 18.</p>
<p>For more information see  ARG05.</p>
<p>((--Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
